WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.812
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Community Helper Gratitude.

00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:15.623
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:15.623 --> 00:00:17.910
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.197
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:20.197 --> 00:00:25.533
Our school is held up by people we see every day.

00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:30.870
The custodian. The cafeteria helpers. The nurse.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:36.206
The crossing guard. The librarian. The people in the office.

00:00:36.206 --> 00:00:41.542
We pass them fast. Today we slow down and really see them.

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:47.641
The crossing guard stands in the rain so we cross safe.

00:00:47.641 --> 00:00:53.739
The custodian makes our room ready before we ever arrive.

00:00:53.739 --> 00:01:00.600
The cafeteria helpers cook and serve until every single child has eaten.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:07.461
The nurse helps when bodies hurt. The librarian keeps the stories ready. That is real work.

00:01:07.461 --> 00:01:14.322
Noticing is the first part. The second part is a thank-you that really reaches them.

00:01:14.322 --> 00:01:20.420
You can say it with words: "Thank you for keeping us safe."

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:27.281
You can make a drawing and give it. Or wave — and wait until they see it.

00:01:27.281 --> 00:01:33.380
Pick one helper in your mind. Picture your thank-you reaching them today.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:38.716
A school full of helpers, seen clearly. That is a good place to learn.

00:01:38.716 --> 00:01:44.052
And if anything ever feels too big, these are grown-ups who help. Tell one. Always.

00:01:44.052 --> 00:01:46.339
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:49.388
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:01:49.388 --> 00:01:52.438
You're ready for what's next.
